/*
  EventHistoryTable.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0042 · EventHistoryTable (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `EventHistoryTable` resolves (table "EventHistoryTable") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/security-access/EventHistoryTable.tsx — its columns,
  badges, panel heading, and DataTable emptyMessage). The "All Closed" / "Open/
  Venting" window summaries come from the web `helpers.ts::windowSummary` (hardcoded
  English there); routed through the facade here so the native code holds no literals.
  The last group backs the native-only chrome (loading / error / retry) the Apple HIG
  states contract requires.
*/

